{"id": "JAH-FOG-SIMTOOL-000003", "slug": "fog-simulators-tooling", "title": "Fog Simulators and Tooling \u2014 Core concepts", "edition": "public", "src": "public-harvest", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "fog data science database record", "ladder_rank": 5, "body": "Public edition. Public fog data science knowledge, fact-checked reference. Core concepts: iFogSim; EdgeCloudSim; YAFS; FogNetSim++; discrete-event simulation; placement policies; mobility modeling; workload traces; energy models; simulator comparison.", "concepts": ["iFogSim", "EdgeCloudSim", "YAFS", "FogNetSim++", "discrete-event simulation", "placement policies", "mobility modeling", "workload traces", "energy models", "simulator comparison"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Core operation executed", "code": "// core: discrete-event style loop latency over simulated modules\nconst modules=T.tasks;const events=[];let t=0;\nfor(const m of modules){t+=m.ms;events.push({module:m.id,finish_ms:t});}\nconst avg=t/modules.length;\nJ({events,total_ms:t,avg_loop_ms:+avg.toFixed(2),under_cloud:avg<T.cloud_rtt_ms});assert(t===30,'total');assert(avg<T.cloud_rtt_ms,'fog faster');", "verified_output": "{\"events\":[{\"module\":\"app-mod-a\",\"finish_ms\":10},{\"module\":\"app-mod-b\",\"finish_ms\":25},{\"module\":\"app-mod-c\",\"finish_ms\":30}],\"total_ms\":30,\"avg_loop_ms\":10,\"under_cloud\":true}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_order": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt item 89 (fog data science)", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Fog Simulators and Tooling Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["fog-nodes-orchestration", "fog-latency-optimization", "fog-future-research", "fog-data-science-master"], "sibling_edition": "fog-simulators-tooling-signature"}}
{"id": "JAH-FOG-SIMTOOL-000004", "slug": "fog-simulators-tooling", "title": "Fog Simulators and Tooling \u2014 Worked example", "edition": "public", "src": "public-harvest", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "fog data science database record", "ladder_rank": 7, "body": "Public edition. Public fog data science knowledge, fact-checked reference. A researcher models a 50-node city fog in iFogSim, compares three placement policies, and reports average loop latency and total energy before buying any hardware.", "concepts": ["iFogSim", "EdgeCloudSim", "YAFS", "FogNetSim++", "discrete-event simulation", "placement policies", "mobility modeling", "workload traces", "energy models", "simulator comparison"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Worked example end to end", "code": "// end-to-end: compare two placement policies across three seeds\nconst seeds=[7,42,99];const policies={greedy:[18,17,19],random:[24,29,22]};\nconst mean=a=>a.reduce((x,y)=>x+y,0)/a.length;\nconst res=Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(policies).map(([p,v])=>[p,+mean(v).toFixed(2)]));\nJ({seeds,policy_means:res,winner:res.greedy<res.random?'greedy':'random'});assert(res.greedy<res.random,'greedy wins');", "verified_output": "{\"seeds\":[7,42,99],\"policy_means\":{\"greedy\":18,\"random\":25},\"winner\":\"greedy\"}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_order": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt item 89 (fog data science)", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Fog Simulators and Tooling Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["fog-nodes-orchestration", "fog-latency-optimization", "fog-future-research", "fog-data-science-master"], "sibling_edition": "fog-simulators-tooling-signature"}}
{"id": "JAH-FOG-SIMTOOL-000005", "slug": "fog-simulators-tooling", "title": "Fog Simulators and Tooling \u2014 Safety, limits, and failure modes", "edition": "public", "src": "public-harvest", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "fog data science database record", "ladder_rank": 9, "body": "Public edition. Public fog data science knowledge, fact-checked reference. Simulators abstract away real network jitter, hardware quirks, and security overhead; results are comparative guides, not deployment guarantees. Simulator choice shapes the answer.", "concepts": ["iFogSim", "EdgeCloudSim", "YAFS", "FogNetSim++", "discrete-event simulation", "placement policies", "mobility modeling", "workload traces", "energy models", "simulator comparison"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Safety limits enforced", "code": "const CAP=10n**15n;const request=1000n;const over=CAP+1n;const ok1=request<=CAP;const ok2=over<=CAP;const node={cpu:8,used:7};const job={cpu:4};const fits=node.used+job.cpu<=node.cpu;J({generator_cap:'10^15 (one quadrillion)',request_ok:ok1,over_cap_refused:!ok2,oversized_job_refused:!fits});assert(ok1&&!ok2&&!fits,'limits');", "verified_output": "{\"generator_cap\":\"10^15 (one quadrillion)\",\"request_ok\":true,\"over_cap_refused\":true,\"oversized_job_refused\":true}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_order": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt item 89 (fog data science)", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Fog Simulators and Tooling Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["fog-nodes-orchestration", "fog-latency-optimization", "fog-future-research", "fog-data-science-master"], "sibling_edition": "fog-simulators-tooling-signature"}}
{"id": "JAH-FOG-SIMTOOL-000006", "slug": "fog-simulators-tooling", "title": "Fog Simulators and Tooling \u2014 Beginner teaching exercise", "edition": "public", "src": "public-harvest", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "fog data science database record", "ladder_rank": 2, "body": "Public edition. Public fog data science knowledge, fact-checked reference. Start simple: define the fog computing stack (device, fog, cloud tiers) for Fog Simulators and Tooling, identify which tier each workload belongs on, and verify with a small latency-budget calculation before scaling up.", "concepts": ["iFogSim", "EdgeCloudSim", "YAFS", "FogNetSim++", "discrete-event simulation", "placement policies", "mobility modeling", "workload traces", "energy models", "simulator comparison"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Beginner teaching exercise: cloud vs fog round trip", "code": "const fog=T.nodes[0].rtt_ms;const cloud=T.cloud_rtt_ms;const saved=cloud-fog;const pct=Math.round(100*saved/cloud);J({fog_rtt_ms:fog,cloud_rtt_ms:cloud,saved_ms:saved,saving_pct:pct});assert(saved>0,'saves');assert(pct>50,'big win');", "verified_output": "{\"fog_rtt_ms\":5,\"cloud_rtt_ms\":130,\"saved_ms\":125,\"saving_pct\":96}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_order": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt item 89 (fog data science)", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Fog Simulators and Tooling Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["fog-nodes-orchestration", "fog-latency-optimization", "fog-future-research", "fog-data-science-master"], "sibling_edition": "fog-simulators-tooling-signature"}}
{"id": "JAH-FOG-SIMTOOL-000007", "slug": "fog-simulators-tooling", "title": "Fog Simulators and Tooling \u2014 Advanced pattern", "edition": "public", "src": "public-harvest", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "fog data science database record", "ladder_rank": 11, "body": "Public edition. Public fog data science knowledge, fact-checked reference. Advanced use of Fog Simulators and Tooling combines neighboring topics: feed its outputs into the next tier, add verification checkpoints at each handoff, and automate the pipeline once the manual path is proven.", "concepts": ["iFogSim", "EdgeCloudSim", "YAFS", "FogNetSim++", "discrete-event simulation", "placement policies", "mobility modeling", "workload traces", "energy models", "simulator comparison"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Advanced pattern: weighted failover across fog nodes", "code": "const nodes=T.nodes.map(n=>({...n,load:0}));let dropped=0;for(let i=0;i<40;i++){const live=nodes.filter(n=>n.load<n.cpu*10);if(!live.length){dropped++;continue;}const n=live.reduce((a,b)=>(a.load/a.cpu)<=(b.load/b.cpu)?a:b);n.load++;}const loads=nodes.map(n=>n.load);const over=nodes.filter(n=>n.load>n.cpu*10);const shares=nodes.map(n=>({id:n.id,share:+(n.load/n.cpu).toFixed(2)}));J({assigned:40-dropped,dropped,loads,shares,over_capacity:over.length});assert(dropped===0,'no drops');assert(over.length===0,'capacity');", "verified_output": "{\"assigned\":40,\"dropped\":0,\"loads\":[12,6,22],\"shares\":[{\"id\":\"fog-1\",\"share\":1.5},{\"id\":\"fog-2\",\"share\":1.5},{\"id\":\"fog-3\",\"share\":1.38}],\"over_capacity\":0}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_order": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt item 89 (fog data science)", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Fog Simulators and Tooling Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["fog-nodes-orchestration", "fog-latency-optimization", "fog-future-research", "fog-data-science-master"], "sibling_edition": "fog-simulators-tooling-signature"}}
